#: src/features/analytics/Settings.tsx
msgid "A change applies to new events. Days already counted keep their zone."
msgstr "Perubahan terpakai pada peristiwa baharu. Hari yang sudah dikira mengekalkan zonnya."

#: src/features/analytics/Goals.tsx
msgid "A changed goal is counted again over the days the detailed records are kept."
msgstr "Matlamat yang diubah dikira semula merentas hari rekod terperinci disimpan."

#: src/features/analytics/Funnels.tsx
msgid "A funnel follows each visit step by step, so it covers at most 90 days at once, or 31 days for a property with more than 10 million events a month. Pick a shorter range."
msgstr "Corong mengikuti setiap lawatan langkah demi langkah, jadi ia merangkumi paling banyak 90 hari sekali gus, atau 31 hari untuk properti dengan lebih 10 juta peristiwa sebulan. Pilih julat yang lebih pendek."

#: src/features/analytics/Funnels.tsx
msgid "A funnel is made of two to eight goals in a row. Make at least two goals first."
msgstr "Corong terdiri daripada dua hingga lapan matlamat berturutan. Cipta sekurang-kurangnya dua matlamat dahulu."

#: src/features/analytics/Funnels.tsx
msgid "A funnel needs each visit’s steps, which are kept since {day}. Earlier days only have totals, so they cannot show a funnel."
msgstr "Corong memerlukan langkah setiap lawatan, yang disimpan sejak {day}. Hari lebih awal hanya mempunyai jumlah, jadi ia tidak boleh menunjukkan corong."

#: src/features/analytics/Funnels.tsx
msgid "A funnel needs each visit’s steps, which are no longer kept for this range."
msgstr "Corong memerlukan langkah setiap lawatan, yang tidak lagi disimpan untuk julat ini."

#: src/features/analytics/Funnels.tsx
msgid "A funnel shows how many visitors go from one goal to the next within a visit, and where they leave."
msgstr "Corong menunjukkan berapa ramai pelawat bergerak dari satu matlamat ke yang seterusnya dalam satu lawatan, dan di mana mereka keluar."

#: src/features/analytics/Goals.tsx
msgid "A goal counts the visitors who view a page, send an event or scroll far enough, and the revenue they bring."
msgstr "Matlamat mengira pelawat yang melihat halaman, menghantar peristiwa atau menatal cukup jauh, dan hasil yang mereka bawa."

#: src/features/analytics/Alerts.tsx
msgid "A goal’s conversions yesterday were at most half its daily average of the week before."
msgstr "Penukaran matlamat semalam paling banyak separuh daripada purata hariannya pada minggu sebelumnya."

#: src/features/analytics/Sharing.tsx
msgid "A link shows only its views of this property, read-only, without filters or segments. Revoking or deleting it stops it at once."
msgstr "Pautan hanya menunjukkan paparan properti ini yang anda pilih, baca sahaja, tanpa penapis atau segmen. Membatalkan atau memadamnya menghentikannya serta-merta."

#: src/features/analytics/Goals.tsx
msgid "A new goal also counts the days the detailed records are kept, not only from today."
msgstr "Matlamat baharu juga mengira hari rekod terperinci disimpan, bukan sahaja dari hari ini."

#: src/features/analytics/Annotations.tsx
msgid "A new key was made"
msgstr "Kunci baharu dicipta"

#: src/features/analytics/Sharing.tsx
msgid "A new password signs out everyone who unlocked the link."
msgstr "Kata laluan baharu melog keluar semua orang yang membuka pautan."

#: src/features/analytics/Goals.tsx
msgid "a page visit or an event from your site or app"
msgstr "lawatan halaman atau peristiwa daripada tapak atau aplikasi anda"

#: src/features/analytics/Goals.tsx
msgid "A path. * stands for one part of it, ** for any number of them."
msgstr "Satu laluan. * mewakili satu bahagiannya, ** sebarang bilangan."

#: src/features/analytics/Settings.tsx
msgid "A prop name has at most 300 characters and does not start with $ or yuva_."
msgstr "Nama prop paling banyak 300 aksara dan tidak bermula dengan $ atau yuva_."

#: src/features/analytics/Sharing.tsx
msgid "A property can have at most 50 share links. Delete one first."
msgstr "Satu properti boleh mempunyai paling banyak 50 pautan kongsi. Padam satu dahulu."

#: src/features/analytics/parts.tsx
msgid "A range can be at most 400 days long. Pick a shorter one."
msgstr "Satu julat boleh sepanjang paling banyak 400 hari. Pilih yang lebih pendek."

#: src/features/analytics/Alerts.tsx
msgid "A site sent 10 or more visits yesterday and none in the 28 days before."
msgstr "Satu tapak menghantar 10 atau lebih lawatan semalam dan tiada dalam 28 hari sebelumnya."

#: src/features/analytics/Settings.tsx
msgid "A tracked prop is also kept in the daily totals, so its breakdown lasts after the detailed records are gone, and it shows as a chip on the Events view."
msgstr "Prop yang dijejaki juga disimpan dalam jumlah harian, jadi pecahannya kekal selepas rekod terperinci hilang, dan ia ditunjukkan sebagai cip dalam paparan Peristiwa."

#: src/features/analytics/text.ts
msgid "A visitor's page or screen views without a gap of 30 minutes, within one day."
msgstr "Paparan halaman atau skrin pelawat tanpa jurang 30 minit, dalam satu hari."

#: src/features/analytics/text.ts
msgid "A visitor's page views without a gap of 30 minutes, within one day."
msgstr "Paparan halaman pelawat tanpa jurang 30 minit, dalam satu hari."

#: src/features/analytics/text.ts
msgid "A visitor's screen views without a gap of 30 minutes, within one day. Each launch of the app starts a new visit."
msgstr "Paparan skrin pelawat tanpa jurang 30 minit, dalam satu hari. Setiap pelancaran apl memulakan lawatan baharu."

