#: src/features/analytics/Install.tsx
msgid "Content blockers often stop scripts from other domains. Serving the script and its endpoint from your own site keeps those visitors counted. The Yuva server has to trust your proxy’s forwarded address; otherwise all visitors look like one."
msgstr "Penyekat kandungan sering menghentikan skrip daripada domain lain. Menyajikan skrip dan titik akhirnya daripada tapak anda sendiri mengekalkan pelawat itu dikira. Pelayan Yuva mesti mempercayai alamat yang dimajukan proksi anda; jika tidak semua pelawat kelihatan seperti satu."

